  "experiment": {
    "notes": "Thirteen predeclared candidates isolate surface features, proper left-tail training and causal calibration-only adaptive blending, then test their pairwise and three-way combinations. One finalist per six explicit mechanism group freezes on 2016-2018 equal-cell raw CRPS before any later score is read. Actual DTE is calibration cell metadata only and is excluded from every predictor and gate input. Adaptive candidates consume calibration outcomes and therefore prohibit a second calibration map. The external primary guard retains the unchanged raw incumbent unless a finalist strictly improves equal-cell CRPS and each index absolute below-5% PIT-rate deviation is no worse within 1e-12. Reused 2019-2025 is inspected research history, not a fresh holdout.",
